  "findings": [
    "Fully read original EN1040/KO984 guide lines and EN250/KO246 quiz lines. All18 figures actually viewed. No coverage inferred from grep.",
    "Pinned review to Calico3.32.2/Kubernetes-tested1.34–1.36, separated BGP control plane from encapsulation and BGP-free Felix routing; no latest-equals-compatible inference.",
    "Corrected ASN reserved/private distinctions, iBGP propagation, vendor-only Weight/AD defaults, BIRD best-path priorities and implementation-specific TTL. Calico-pinned BIRD source9111ec3c is v0.3.3+birdv1.6.8, not fabricated2.0.8.",
    "Corrected RR session math using total/client counts:100total2RR197sessions;500total2RR997. Removed unsupported hard node/memory limits. KDD annotations preserve node fields; RR nodes leave automatic mesh immediately. Explicit replacement sessions/routes/traffic verified before disabling old mesh via field-preserving merge patch.",
    "Corrected BGPPeer keepaliveTime spelling/duration, unsupported holdTime/restartTime, sourceAddress enum, filters string references, and numAllowedLocalASNumbers as AS-path loop prevention relaxation rather than TTL.",
    "BGPConfiguration bindMode None listens without address restriction rather than disabling BGP; nodeMeshPassword authenticates mesh rather than enabling IPv4. nodeMeshMaxRestartTime requires duration string and only scopes automatic mesh.",
    "prefixAdvertisements source applies communities to existing matching Pod routes too, not merely Service routes. It neither originates nor aggregates prefixes. Explicit BGPFilter export Accept bypasses built-in aggregation/tagging; accepted-route addCommunity operation used explicitly.",
    "Preserved current native Calico LoadBalancer IPAM with dedicated allowedUses:LoadBalancer pool, loadBalancerClass calico, owned VIP range and ready endpoints; allocation/advertisement/return-path distinct. Removed nonexistent per-Service bgp-advertise opt-out. Covering aggregates defeat host-route-only suppression. Kubernetes1.36 externalIPs deprecation verified.",
    "Corrected BGPFilter In0/0 accept-all and NotIn0/0 reject-none to Equaldefault/approvedunderlay/unconditionalReject; prefixLength object includes required borrowed/mobility32routes. Native pinned BIRD reproduced old errors and passed40before-after route cases.",
    "Corrected GTSM threshold to256-hops (oneedge requires255). Source BIRD Hold default240s with negotiated minimum; explicitkeepalive does not setHold=3x. GR requires negotiated support plus live forwarding and mayblackhole stale routes; no invented BFD API.",
    "Removed hardcoded MD5 passwords; namespace/key/RBAC/router prerequisites explicit. Replaced mixed/undefined Cisco/EOS/Junos recipes with version-scoped adaptation and verified Junosroute-filterfragment. Router runtime/failover remains untested and explicitly scoped.",
    "Corrected explicit IPv4/IPv6 BIRD sockets, actualprotocolnames, node-vs-workstation diagnostics. Multi-rack/DC examples retain AS-loop,returnroute,failure-domain requirements. Repaired RFC5082 label/source links and Korean previous-guide label.",
    "All original30quizquestions reviewed; ambiguous options, RRtransition, GR/authguarantees andcommands corrected. Addedfour questions covering real filter/aggregation defects;34answers consistent with options and prose.",
    "18figuresreviewed:11retainedwithsemanticcaptions,7wrong/duplicatedreferencesremoved. Underlyingassetsunchanged;qualifieddiagramlimitationsretainedinreport."
  ],
